  {
    "episode_id": 92309,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92309.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "And that work has now moved on into your career in Washington as you've been a member of the House Ag Committee since day one, since you began in January 2011. So it's been almost a full seven years now. And you are the only Missourian on that committee, and I believe have been that entire time. How's that, as the only Missourian on the committee, how has that influenced your work where sometimes there are issues from other parts of the state that you don't necessarily have in the fourth district? But it seems like you try to keep up on all of this as well.",
