      {
        "text": "The Trans-Pacific Partnership (TPP) would generate an additional $5.5 billion annually for the U.S. farm economy.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Immediate action on trade agreements is necessary due to competitive pressure from China.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Commodity prices are currently low.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "China is actively pursuing trade relationships outside the original TPP framework.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a large domestic supply of agricultural commodities.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The TPP historically served to exclude China from key regional markets.",
        "confidence": 0.94
